### [L8] API Testing & Debugging: REST Client test definitions for Metal Masala

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1
@nativeUrl = http://localhost:4001

### 1. Health check probe [L5, L6]
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Versioned Health check
GET {{apiUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 3. List all categories with product counts [L10]
GET {{apiUrl}}/categories
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create category (Manager+) [L10]
# @name createCategory
POST {{apiUrl}}/categories
X-Dev-Role: manager
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anklets & Charms",
  "nameHi": "पायल व आकर्षण",
  "slug": "anklets-charms",
  "description": "Handcrafted silver-plated anklets with melodious bells.",
  "sortOrder": 9
}

### 5. Create category with duplicate slug (Conflict 409) [L10]
POST {{apiUrl}}/categories
X-Dev-Role: manager
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anklets & Charms",
  "slug": "anklets-charms"
}

### 6. Update category [L10]
PATCH {{apiUrl}}/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.$.data.id}}
X-Dev-Role: manager
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated description for festive anklets collection."
}

### 7. Delete category with referencing products (Fails with 409) [L10]
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/categories/jhumkas
X-Dev-Role: admin

### 8. List products (Default pagination: 12 items) [L11]
GET {{apiUrl}}/products
Accept: application/json

### 9. Filter products by search query, sorting, and price range [L11]
GET {{apiUrl}}/products?q=jhumka&sort=popular&minPrice=400&maxPrice=1200
Accept: application/json

### 10. Filter products by category, material, and finish [L11]
GET {{apiUrl}}/products?category=jhumkas&material=brass&finish=oxidized-silver&inStock=true
Accept: application/json

### 11. Pagination: Page 2 with limit 5 [L11]
GET {{apiUrl}}/products?page=2&limit=5&sort=price-asc
Accept: application/json

### 12. Export products as CSV (Manager+) [L5, L11]
GET {{apiUrl}}/products/export.csv
X-Dev-Role: manager

### 13. Get single product by slug [L11]
# @name getProduct
GET {{apiUrl}}/products/chandni-chowk-jhumka
Accept: application/json

### 14. ETag caching conditional GET (Expect 304 Not Modified) [L2, L11]
GET {{apiUrl}}/products/chandni-chowk-jhumka
If-None-Match: {{getProduct.response.headers.ETag}}

### 15. Product not found (404) [L2]
GET {{apiUrl}}/products/non-existent-jewellery-piece
Accept: application/json

### 16. Create a new product (201 Created + Location header) [L10, L11]
# @name createProduct
POST {{apiUrl}}/products
X-Dev-Role: manager
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jaipur Royal Hasli Choker",
  "slug": "jaipur-royal-hasli-choker",
  "tagline": "A royal collar forged in solid brass with peacock motifs.",
  "description": "Handcrafted heirloom choker with intricate nakashi engravings.",
  "price": 1499,
  "compareAtPrice": 1999,
  "category": "chokers-necklaces",
  "material": "brass",
  "finish": "antique-gold",
  "stock": 8,
  "tags": ["wedding-guest", "statement"],
  "craft": {
    "artisan": "Studio Rangrez",
    "region": "Jaipur, Rajasthan",
    "technique": "Hand-engraved nakashi brass"
  }
}

### 17. Create product validation error (422) [L11]
POST {{apiUrl}}/products
X-Dev-Role: manager
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -50,
  "category": ""
}

### 18. Native HTTP Server Health Probe [L7]
GET {{nativeUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 19. Native HTTP Server Products List [L7]
GET {{nativeUrl}}/native/products?limit=3
Accept: application/json

### 20. Native HTTP Server Echo (POST body parsing) [L7]
POST {{nativeUrl}}/native/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sender": "Student",
  "message": "Testing raw Node.js stream body parser"
}
